{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40902","headline":"宿顾城二首 二 · 张直","name":"宿顾城二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"醉卧夜将半，土底闻鸡啼。\n惊骇问主人，爲我剖荒迷。\n武汤东伐韦，固君含悲凄。\n神夺悔悟魄，幻化爲石鸡。\n形骸仅盈寸，咿喔若啁蜺。\n吾村耕耘叟，多获於锄犂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}